# Web Design Guidelines

When reviewing or polishing web UI, first use:

`~/.cursor/skills/web-design-guidelines/SKILL.md`

Before review, fetch the latest guidelines from:

`https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vercel-labs/web-interface-guidelines/main/command.md`

Then evaluate relevant files for:
- Accessibility and semantic structure.
- Interaction clarity and UX consistency.
- Visual hierarchy, readability, and responsive behavior.
- Common anti-patterns called out by the guideline source.

Report findings in concise `file:line` style when a review is requested.
